      "id": "claim_c55d40fc9ecb43d185a0185e5f6dd8bb",
      "statement": "Host attribution of frozen arms: GRPOModule registers 'reward_model' always, 'unet' as the frozen base only on the ControlNet-policy path (the trainable-policy path assigns unet plainly), and the KL-anchor arms 'reference_unet' / 'reference_controlnet' when a reference_policy is supplied; RewardModule registers its frozen arm as 'denoiser'; ControlNetLatentFlowModule registers the frozen base as 'unet'.",
