      "id": "claim_d6d5887197214ab086f3335997f377c6",
      "statement": "The GRPO, reward and controlnet training shells resolve their pre-process-group device through DevicePolicy().pin() on the real path, while the injected data_provider smoke seam stays on torch.device('cpu') and never constructs a DevicePolicy — the smoke remains GPU-free and launcher-env-free.",
