    {
      "id": "claim_f9314965b2fb49d885f266fc642fffcd",
      "statement": "The DevicePolicy wiring is locked by inspect.getsource guards: three in tests/test_device_policy.py assert that grpo_cli.main, reward_cli.main and controlnet_cli.main construct a DevicePolicy and call .pin() and no longer inline set_device or resolve a bare torch.device('cuda'), and two in tests/test_ddp_warm.py assert the JiT and controlnet warm closures use DevicePolicy.warm_device rather than the deleted free function; a 2-rank spawn smoke (test_controlnet_cli.py::test_main_real_path_pins_each_rank_to_local_gpu) additionally locks that the two ranks receive different per-rank devices instead of collapsing onto cuda:0.",
